      "cooked": "<p>The wiki one, though I love being a nominee and getting a badge, is kinda (at this time) only self serving. I was the only nominated, not because I’m the only one who does anything (there is great work done by others on there!) But because I’ll always be babysitting it everyday, and don’t want to be the only nominee time after time -simply cause it is my baby and I do spend a lot of time on it.</p>",
