      "created_at": "2014-05-08T15:07:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Putting this here so we think about it in the future (originally posted <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/70422#comment-70422\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>):</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I also think some non-individual awards could go out, stuff like funniest thread of the year, best fanfiction and fanart of the year, etc. I think that could be fun to add.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
