      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Putting this here so we think about it in the future (originally posted <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/70422#comment-70422\">here</a>):\n\n[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nI also think some non-individual awards could go out, stuff like funniest thread of the year, best fanfiction and fanart of the year, etc. I think that could be fun to add.\n\n[/quote]\n\n",
