    {
      "id": 100773,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-22T18:23:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Alright, so we currently have forumite awards of:</p><ol>\n<li>\n<em>Inspiring Presence </em>(Morale Booster) – The forum member who, through positive attitude and kind heart, did the most to make the Greater Than Games forums a positive experience over the past year</li>\n<li>\n<em>Bolster Allies </em>(Funniest) – The forum member who was best at making people laugh and providing humorous moments over the past year</li>\n<li>\n<em>Truth Seeker </em>(Lore Master) – The forum member who has done the best job answering questions (rules, facts, mythology, etc.) and otherwise providing useful and accurate information over the past year</li>\n<li>\n<em>Harmony </em>(Top Debater) – The forum member who is best at rationally debating positions (without turning it into a fight) over the past year</li>\n<li>\n<em>Exceeded Expectations </em>(Top Contributor) – The forum member who contributed to the Greater Than Games community with tools and/or accessories&nbsp;the most (including wiki contributions) over the past year</li>\n<li>\n<em>Unique Capabilities </em>(Top Artist) – The forum member who created the best/most Greater Than Games-related art or fanfic over the past year</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And other awards&nbsp;of:</p><ol>\n<li>Funniest Thread of the Year</li>\n<li>Best Fan Fiction&nbsp;of the Year</li>\n<li>Best Fan Art&nbsp;of the Year</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I tried to think of some other non-forumite awards, but haven't come up with any, yet. \"Best Thread of the Year\" seemed odd, as we'll all have different views on that kind of thing. Are there any other qualifiers and/or things that would make for interesting awards?</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:29:10.856Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
